defuss-qemu contains QEMU and the local WebAssembly integration.
QEMU is distributed under GNU GPL version 2; individual source files retain
their existing copyright and license notices. The corresponding imported
source tree, local build scripts and provenance manifests are included in
dist/source.tar.gz. The pinned SDK is identified in scripts/build.py.

Browser support includes third-party code under the notices in dist/licenses.
Firmware origins and licenses are listed in dist/licenses/firmware-README.txt.
Guest operating systems and application images are not included in this package.
